# CourtReach's Cloudflare Worker source. Deliberately NOT tracked while this repo is public:
# it is the one part of the system users never receive a copy of — the app's HTML is
# distributed to every browser by definition, but the worker only ever runs on Cloudflare —
# so publishing it gives away the server side for nothing in return. Nothing here builds or
# deploys from it; it is pasted into the Cloudflare dashboard by hand (see PUSH-SETUP.md).
# The file itself stays on the owner's machine, and earlier revisions remain in git history.
worker.js
